\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs28 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prooemium (w\u246 \'f6rtlich zitiert: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 De Marinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bd. 2). 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Miniatur. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Johannes Albinus (Lucanus), Excerpta ex Blondi decadibus (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   zehn B\u252 \'fccher zur 1. Dekade; 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   zehn B\u252 \'fccher zur 2. Dekade). 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat.}

