\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eingeklebtes Exlibris (s. o.). II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Exlibris-Stempel mit Wappen (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex libris Friderici de Schennis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Servius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentarius in Vergilii opera}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.}

