\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Seneca}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Trag\u246 \'f6dien}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 1; 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 2; 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 3; 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 4; 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 5; 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 6; 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 7; 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 8; 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 146b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr. 9; 146b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 10). 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kaufeintrag (s.o.). 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Schreibproben (u.a. Alphabet). 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.}

