\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 nhalt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Marcus Tullius Cicero}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Orationes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Oratio de imperio Cn. Pompei. 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Oratio ad Catilinam. 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Milone. 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro rege Deiotaro. 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Marcello. 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Ligario. 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Licinio Archia poeta. 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Oratio pridie quam in exilium iret. 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  In Catilinam I. 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   In Catilinam II. 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   In Catilinam III. 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   In Catilinam IV. 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Ultima oratio ad Catilinam. 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Gaius Sallustius Crispus, Invectiva in M. Tullium Ciceronem. 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Cicero, In C. Sallustium Crispum. 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Post reditum ad Quirites oratio. 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Post reditum in senatu oratio. 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Oratio in Vatinium. 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Licinio Archia poeta. 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Oratio de provinciis consularibus. 126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Cn. Plancio. 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro L. Valerio Flacco. 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Quintio. 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Cluentio. 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Murena. 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De Haruspicum responsis. 242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Caelio. 255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Cornelio Balbo. 268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Sestio. 284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 310\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Cornelio Balbo. 310\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 327\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Publio Sylla. 327\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 334\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Gaio Rabirio postumo. 334\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 340\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Rabirio pro duellionis reo. 340\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 358\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Aulo Caecina. 358\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 366\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Pro Roscio Comedo (Ende fehlt). 367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 390\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Pro Roscio Amerino (unterbricht 386\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   unten, 387\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer bis auf zwei Zeilen unten). 391\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 410\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   In Lucium Pisonem (Fragmente). 410\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 415\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De lege agraria I bzw. Contra Servilium Rullum I. 415\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 434\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Contra Servilium Rullum II. 434\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 436\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Contra Servilium Rullum III.}

