\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Eintrag des 16. Jhs.: huius Aristeae me[\u8230 \'85]t Eusebius: De preparatione evangelica: in principio libri octavi et capitolo 3\u176 \'b0. Item Josephus in antiquitatibus: libro xij\u176 \'b0 capitolo 2\u176 \'b0. II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Praefatio. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aristeas Epistolographus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistula ad Philocratem}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (in der lateinischen \u220 \'dcbersetzung des Matthias Palmerius). 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. }

