1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Idem, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De opificio Dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sophronius Eusebius Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vita Lactantii}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tabula (alphabetisch). 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.}

