\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   sp\u228 \'e4terer Eintrag (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno domini 1283\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vacat. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Damascenus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De fide orthodoxa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Ps.-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dionysius Areopagita}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Opuscula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hauke / Freckmann.}

