\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Zusammenfassung des Inhalts der 6 Kom\u246 \'f6dien (gleiche Hand, die durchgehend Kommentare eingetragen hat).  4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Publius Terentius Afer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Comoediae sex}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog; 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kom\u246 \'f6die 1; 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog; 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kom\u246 \'f6die 2; 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog; 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kom\u246 \'f6die 3; 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog; 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kom\u246 \'f6die 4; 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog; 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kom\u246 \'f6die 5; 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog; 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kom\u246 \'f6die 6; Schreiber notiert am Ende das Jahr 1448). 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= Nachsatzbl.) vacant.}

