\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vacant (Blatt geknickt und lose). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Tudeschis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura in Decretales}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Teil I/2). 345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   zweizeilige {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notiz}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini 1455 mensis marcij die vero 19 per me f. thenis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

