ur, von anderer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iste liber dat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   a \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Sigismund\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   de \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]. 191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Maphaeus Vegius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber XIII}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Appendix Vergiliana. 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat.}

