 \f1\lang1033\fs24   Antonius de Gayneriis, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De venenis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Theobaldus Loneti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De peste}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Christophorus Barzizius, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Introductorium in medicinam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   medizinischer Index (alphabetisch). 272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus de Abano}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De venenis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. }

