\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   sp\u228 \'e4tere Zutat (Titelnennung). I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius I., Papa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dialogorum libri IV}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch I; 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch II; 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch III; 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Buch IV). 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant (Bl. 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   getilgte alte Notiz).}

