\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Name des Autors (16. Jh.) und Signatur von Petrus Victorius (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  No 36\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Leonardo Bruni}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Leonardo Aretino), \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primo bello punico}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   steht unterhalb des Textes: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Finito libro chiamato primo bello punico fatto per [\u8230 \'85] Leonardo [\u8230 \'85] Bruni}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.}

