\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   verklebt. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   zwei Eintr\u228 \'e4ge: sakrale Widmung ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [...] altissimo iddio e della sua gloriosissima madre vergine madonna santa Maria}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) und sp\u228 \'e4terer Schenkungsvermerk (s. o.). 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Piero de\rquote  Ricci (?), Sonett. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Einf\u252 \'fchrung. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat19 Francesco <d' Ubaldino>}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Arithmetik}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Idem, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 La regola della luna}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   astrologische Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen (verfasst 1466 in Rom). 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant (Bl. 65 Versoseite hinterklebt).  }

