\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Verweise auf Zeugnisse des hl. Bernhard (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex dictis Bernardis\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kurzzitat nach dem hl. Paulus. Getilgte Inschrift (noch lesbar \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ill\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   astronomische Vorbemerkungen (Planeten etc.). 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bartolomeo della Rocca}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (gen. Cocles), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Physionomia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant). 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Bartolomeo della Rocca, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Chyromantia magna}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Bartolomeo della Rocca, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Chyromantia parva}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   nachgetragene Schenkungsnotiz (s. o.). 172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.}

