ld{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Didascalicon de studio legendi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 117a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Idem, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Metra super librum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 117b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 117c\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 148a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Idem, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In Ecclesiasten}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 148b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  148f\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[7].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speculum Beatae Virginis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.}

