\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Bartolus de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In Digestum vetus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Finita est haec secunda pars digesti veteris Bartoli de Saxo ferrato Perusii anno m\u176 \'b0cccc\u176 \'b0lvii mensis julii xx}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.}

