\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Roberto Valturio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De re militari}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Titel in gro\u223 \'dfen schwarzen Majuskeln. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog (Widmung an Sigismundo Malatesta). 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch I. 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch II. 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch III. 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch IV. 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch V. 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch VI. 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch VII. 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch VIII. 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch IX. 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch X (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant). 160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XI. 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XII.}

