\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antonio Francesco Doni}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 La villa Fucchera}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= Le cinque ville, als Widmungsexemplar f\u252 \'fcr Johann Jakob Fugger). I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Titel. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Widmung. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Untertitel (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Libro primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kupferstich. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Vorspann. 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Schemazeichnung. 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Villa civile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 1. Villa). 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Podere di spasso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 2. Villa). 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Possessione di ricriatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= 3. Villa). 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   